+TrueCrypt 6.2a Ground-Truth RUN2 transport
+
+Purpose:
+  File-hosted, non-hidden, 16 MiB, AES, RIPEMD-160, FAT, quick format.
+
+Executable SHA-256:
+  e8e44b41da05c05aa39dbeb3a6f938dd23ada840880150d96af8dc5197ab3b7c  gt_format_quick.exe
+
+Important:
+  RUN2_PREP.BAT copies the executable to C:\GT_RUN2 and DOES NOT execute it.
+  RUN2_EXEC.BAT is one-shot and refuses to overwrite existing RUN2 outputs.
+
+Expected RUN2 working outputs:
+  C:\GT_RUN2\truecrypt-gt.bin
+  C:\GT_RUN2\gt-run2-fat-quick.tc
+  C:\GT_RUN2\run2.exit.txt
+
+Do not rerun after the first meaningful XP execution.
